{"base_rate":0.05519480519480519,"brier":0.04089821428571428,"bss":0.21573313119062065,"bss_hi":0.39015114134829953,"bss_lo":-0.058685137894717666,"chart":{"base":[133.6,65.8],"fp":[203.1,257.9],"lead":"62,269.9 272,246 482,226.5 692,185.2","note":{"base":"skill 0.22 — higher than 30% of cities","fp":"low end +0pp, high end +25pp","lead":"day-1 error 0.9 °C — better than 79% of cities","rel":"promised 0% → rained 1%; promised 27% → rained 20%"},"rel":"64.2,462.3 234.6,379.6"},"country":"IR","deep":false,"depth":["Rain-probability calibration","Calibration curve","Seasonal split"],"ece":0.02183441558441558,"ess":343.5445333753875,"html":{"answer":"\n<h2 id=\"answer\">The short answer for Isfahan</h2>\n<div class=\"verdict\">\n<p class=\"lead\"><b>The Isfahan rain forecast is moderately skilful, though 2 points on its probability scale are off by more than chance explains.</b></p>\n<p>When it says rain is <i>near certain</i> (51%), believe about\n<b>34%</b>. When it says rain is <i>very unlikely</i>\n(0%), there is still roughly a <b>0%</b> chance.</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">Based on 616 days, 2024-04-26 to\n2026-02-27. \"Rain\" means at least 0.2 mm measured at\nthe station, 20.6 km from the forecast grid point.\nSkill score 0.22, ranked 149 of\n213 &mdash; but see the rank <i>range</i>\n(61&ndash;191) before reading anything into\nthat position.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>What the percentages actually mean here</h3>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th class=\"num\">It said</th><th class=\"num\">It rained</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Days</th><th>Verdict</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='num'>0%</td><td class='num'><b>0%</b></td><td class='num'>411</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>3%</td><td class='num'><b>4%</b></td><td class='num'>55</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>10%</td><td class='num'><b>9%</b></td><td class='num'>85</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>51%</td><td class='num'><b>34%</b></td><td class='num'>65</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">2 of 4 groups are further from honest than chance\nalone can explain. The rest are indistinguishable from a perfect forecast.</p>\n","card":"\n<div class=\"gcard\">\n  <p class=\"gcard-head\"><b>Isfahan</b> <span class=\"muted\">Iran</span></p>\n  <p class=\"gcard-tier\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Moderately skilful</span>\n    <span class=\"muted\">2 points off by more than chance</span></p>\n  <dl class=\"gcard-stats\">\n    <div><dt>Skill score</dt><dd>0.22</dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Rank</dt><dd>61&ndash;191\n      <span class=\"muted\">of 213</span></dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Record</dt><dd>616 <span class=\"muted\">days</span></dd></div>\n  </dl>\n  <p class=\"gcard-more\"><a href=\"#answer\">The full verdict for\n    Isfahan &darr;</a></p>\n</div>","curve":"\n<h2 id=\"curve\">The calibration curve</h2>\n<p>Each dot is a group of days sharing a similar forecast. Horizontal position\nis what was promised; vertical is what happened. <b>On the dashed diagonal =\nhonest.</b> Hover any dot for its sample size.</p>\n<figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 430 430\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Calibration curve for Isfahan\"><rect class=\"chart-plot\" x=\"58\" y=\"18\" width=\"354\" height=\"364\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"382\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"58\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"386\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">0%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"146.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"146.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"291.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"291.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"146.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">25%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\