" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 3%&amp;#10;It rained 4% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 55 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"68.62\" cy=\"368.76363636363635\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 10%&amp;#10;It rained 9% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 85 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"92.19223529411764\" cy=\"347.74117647058824\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 51%&amp;#10;It rained 34% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 65 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"237.124\" cy=\"258.8\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(6%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Isfahan the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>winter</b> (0.36) and least in\n<b>summer</b> (-0.19).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>162</td><td class='num'>1%</td><td class='num'>-0.189</td><td class='num'>1.1%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>127</td><td class='num'>12%</td><td class='num'>0.194</td><td class='num'>6.4%</td></tr><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>156</td><td class='num'>11%</td><td class='num'>0.356</td><td class='num'>2.0%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>171</td><td class='num'>0%</td><td class='num'>nan</td><td class='num'>2.9%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":32.65246,"lon":51.67462,"n":616,"n_cities":213,"name":"Isfahan","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.03,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.0,"n":411,"obs":0.004866180048661801,"sig":true},{"hi":0.05,"lo":0.03,"mean":0.030000000000000002,"n":55,"obs":0.03636363636363636,"sig":false},{"hi":0.2,"lo":0.05,"mean":0.09658823529411764,"n":85,"obs":0.09411764705882353,"sig":false},{"hi":1.0,"lo":0.2,"mean":0.506,"n":65,"obs":0.3384615384615385,"sig":true}],"prcp_km":20.6,"provisional":false,"rank":149,"rank_hi":191.0,"rank_lo":61.0,"reliability":0.002982097893681581,"resolution":0.010397615712379309,"skill_pct":null,"slug":"isfahan","station":"","timezone":"Asia/Tehran"}